<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-shishuoxinyu" book-id="b-shishuoxinyu-029" chapter-id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong" source-id="s-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong">
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:robe" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:robe:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>儉吝，其<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:robe:m0006" ref="8ud_nma_oo4">從子</persName>婚，與一單衣，後更責之。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:wife" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">司徒<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:wife:m0002" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>，既貴且富，區宅僮牧，膏田水碓之屬，洛下無比。契疏鞅掌，每與<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:wife:m0034" ref="c46_7o5_azx">夫人</persName>燭下散籌算計。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:plums" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:plums:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName>有好李，賣之，恐人得其種，恆鑽其核。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">王戎</persName><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0002" ref="cxf_421_onp">女</persName>適<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0004" ref="svm_6fh_34r">裴頠</persName>，貸錢數萬。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0012" ref="cxf_421_onp">女</persName>歸，<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0015" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>色不說。<persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:daughter:m0020" ref="cxf_421_onp">女</persName>遽還錢，乃釋然。</p>
  <p id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:wangyin" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="witness_appended_liuxiaobiao_note"><persName id="c-shishuoxinyu-029-jin043-wangrong:wangyin:m0000" ref="48e_04a_3d8">戎</persName>好治生，園田周遍天下，翁嫗二人，常以象牙籌晝夜筭計家資。</p>
</text>
